{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-04T10:37:42.117Z","author":"pi-cert-a","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"a001365e42af6f4640dc5b44","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-04T10:37:42.117Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-04T10:37:42.117Z","author":"pi-cert-a","text":"Gate evidence: npm run release:check green 339/339 (typecheck, release-workflow, build, docstring, coverage, audit:prod 0 vulnerabilities, pack:dry-run, accept:packed, changelog:check with pm-changelog 2026.10.4, publish-attestation ok); ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exits 0; npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both clean. Launcher re-copied byte-identical from pm-ops@2026.10.4 templates (fail-closed probe on unreadable lookup paths). REQUIRED_DEVELOPMENT_VERSION in test/version-contract.ts raised to 2026.10.4.\n\nDogfood (pm-brief-2026.9.26.tgz packed from this tree, installed into a scratch copy of this repo's real tracker):\n- npm: 'npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 brief' rendered the full brief (79 items, budget respected); 'brief next --explain --count 2' ranked pm-brief-4ohy (score 222) and this item pm-brief-m8hh (score 115) with evidence lines.\n- bun: 'bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 brief prompt' rendered the agent handoff prompt (score 247 top item); 'brief stale' listed 5 stale items.\nScratch copy deleted afterwards.\n\npm-github: installed as managed extension pm-github@2026.10.4; read-only preview 'pm github sync --repo unbraind/pm-brief --dry-run' -> 'No pm items linked to unbraind/pm-brief' planned 0. No issues created/modified, no scheduled sync."}]}],"before_hash":"a68b7a268015338463565026e05174613675ef40b035392547461a96b6eeae53","after_hash":"298dcd7827